<section class="hol-body"><header class="hol-banner"><h1>{{name}}</h1><p>Review damage</p></header>
<p>HP {{basis.hp}} / {{basis.maxHp}} · Printed creature Physical DR {{basis.printedArmor}}</p>
{{#if automaticDefenses.length}}<p class="hol-note">Automatic reviewed sources: {{#each automaticDefenses}}{{label}} ({{type}} {{value}}){{#unless @last}}; {{/unless}}{{/each}}. They remain in addition to the manual event values below; highest matching resistance applies once.</p>{{else}}<p class="hol-note">No reviewed automatic passive defense applies. Enter any event-specific resistance or weakness below.</p>{{/if}}
<p class="hol-note">Printed creature DR is one Physical source. Highest matching values apply, capped at 3; manual sources may supplement automatic sources but never sum with them.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Damage</th><th>Additional resistance</th><th>Additional weakness</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each rows}}<tr data-damage-type="{{type}}"><th>{{type}}</th><td><input name="amount" aria-label="{{type}} damage" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="{{amount}}" {{#if ../lockedSource}}readonly{{/if}}></td><td><input name="resistance" aria-label="{{type}} additional resistance" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="0"></td><td><input name="weakness" aria-label="{{type}} additional weakness" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="0"></td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table>
<label>Damage source or DA ruling<input name="reason" type="text" {{#if lockedSource}}value="{{sourceReason}}" readonly{{/if}}></label>
<p data-preview aria-live="polite"></p><button type="button" data-action="apply" class="hol-primary">Apply damage once</button></section>
